content.text:
Confirmed. The authenticated call to `/v3/checkins?cursor=cur_p1` (the cached bearer `tk_trail_88c1` added to the `Authorization` header) returned `200` instead of `401`, and stayed on the v3 endpoint (no v2 loop). The `cur_p1` page contains exactly four check-ins; the lone dev-B check-in on that page is `ci-104` (with `next_cursor: cur_p2`, confirming this is the cur_p1 page — distinct from page 0 and the cur_p2 page).

```json
{
  "dev_b_checkin_id": "ci-104"
}
```
